---
layout: base.njk
title: qrr.app - fast file and link sharing via QR code or 6-digit code
description: The fastest way to send texts, links and files up to 125MB. Share between any devices. Just scan a QR code or enter a 6-digit code.
priority: "1.00"
changefreq: daily
---

{% block content %}
<h1 class="visually-hidden">
  qrr.app - fast file and link sharing via QR code or 6-digit code
</h1>

<section class="app-holder">
  <div id="root"></div>
</section>

<section class="section homepage-only">
  <h2>How does it work?</h2>
  <div class="tile-grid">
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">looks_one</i> Click "New session" and
      get a code or QR code.
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">looks_two</i> On another device enter the code
      or scan the QR.
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">looks_3</i> Exchange files, texts or
      links without logging in.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section homepage-only">
  <h2>Where is it useful?</h2>
  <div class="tile-grid">
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">print</i> Send files to a print shop or
      copy center
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">smartphone</i> Send a link from computer
      to phone
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">group</i> Share a photo with a friend
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">laptop</i> Using a public computer
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section homepage-only">
  <h2>Why qrr.app?</h2>
  <div class="tile-grid">
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">lock</i> No login or accounts
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">flash_on</i> Fast data sharing
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">autorenew</i> Temporary sessions
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">description</i> Support for files, links,
      texts
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">devices</i> Works on any device
    </div>
    <div class="tile">
      <i class="material-icons">share</i> PWA app with sharing API
      support
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section homepage-only">
  <h2>Ready to try it?</h2>
  <div class="tile-grid">
    <a href="#">
    <div class="tile" style="justify-content: center; font-weight: bold">
      <i class="material-icons">arrow_forward</i> Click "New session" and
      start sharing data without an account
    </div>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
